-        "Current snapshot id: $0. Parallel snapshot operations are not supported: $1",
-        current_snapshot_id_, req->ShortDebugString()));
-    return SetupError(resp->mutable_error(), MasterErrorPB::PARALLEL_SNAPSHOT_OPERATION, s);
